<h1>Accesso diretto — <?= e($doc['title']) ?></h1><p>Override sul singolo documento: prevale sui permessi della raccolta. Nessun permesso equivale a nessun accesso; il destinatario deve comunque essere membro del workspace.</p><p><a href="/documents/<?= (int)$doc['id'] ?>">Torna al documento</a></p><h2>Permessi raccolta ereditati</h2><?php if(!$inherited): ?><p>Nessuno.</p><?php else: ?><ul><?php foreach($inherited as $a): ?><li><?= e($a['subject_name']) ?> — <?= e($a['role']) ?></li><?php endforeach; ?></ul><?php endif; ?><h2>Override diretti</h2><table class="card"><tr><th>Soggetto</th><th>Tipo</th><th>Ruolo</th><th>Azione</th></tr><?php foreach($direct as $a): ?><tr><td><?= e($a['subject_name']) ?></td><td><?= e($a['subject_type']) ?></td><td><?= e($a['role']) ?></td><td><form method="post" action="/documents/<?= (int)$doc['id'] ?>/access/<?= e($a['subject_type']) ?>/<?= (int)$a['subject_id'] ?>/remove"><?= \Archium\Support\Csrf::field() ?><button class="btn-sm danger">Rimuovi</button></form></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?></table><form method="post" action="/documents/<?= (int)$doc['id'] ?>/access" class="card form-card"><?= \Archium\Support\Csrf::field() ?><label>Tipo soggetto</label><select name="subject_type"><option value="user">Utenti</option><option value="group">Gruppi</option></select><p>Seleziona soggetti del tipo scelto:</p><div class="checkbox-list"><h3>Utenti</h3><?php foreach($members as $m): ?><label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" name="subject_ids[]" value="<?= (int)$m['user_id'] ?>"><?= e($m['name']) ?> — <?= e($m['email']) ?></label><?php endforeach; ?><h3>Gruppi</h3><?php foreach($groups as $g): ?><label class="checkbox-row"><input type="checkbox" name="subject_ids[]" value="<?= (int)$g['id'] ?>"><?= e($g['name']) ?></label><?php endforeach; ?></div><label>Ruolo</label><select name="role"><option value="viewer">Viewer</option><option value="editor">Editore (non elimina)</option><option value="admin">Amministratore</option></select><button>Applica ai selezionati</button></form>